        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Upfront Pricing</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Clear Quote Before We Start</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Broken Key Extraction Experts</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Professional Broken Key Extraction Throughout Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A broken key is one of those situations that catches you completely off guard. Whether it snapped off in your front door deadbolt, your car ignition, a padlock, or a storage unit lock, the immediate instinct is to try to get it out yourself. That instinct is almost always wrong. Improvised tools — tweezers, paperclips, bobby pins, super glue on a stick — push the fragment deeper, bend the surrounding pins, and turn a simple extraction into an expensive lock replacement.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            1st Capital Locksmith uses professional broken key extraction tools designed specifically for this job. Our locksmiths are experienced with all types of lock cylinders and can remove key fragments cleanly in most cases without damaging the lock body or internal components. After the extraction, we assess whether the lock sustained any damage during the break and whether a repair or replacement is warranted.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We also carry key cutting equipment on our vehicles, so in most cases we can cut you a new key on the same visit right after the extraction. We serve homeowners, drivers, business owners, and property managers throughout Dover, Milford, Smyrna, Camden, Harrington, and all of Kent County, Delaware.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Photo Slot 1 -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-[#F8F8F5] aspect-[4/3] flex items-center justify-center">
            <img
              src="/images/broken-key-extraction-service.jpg"
              alt="Professional broken key extraction from a door lock in Delaware"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="600"
              height="450"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">Broken Key Extraction For:</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                "Residential Door Locks & Deadbolts",
                "Car Door Locks",
                "Car Ignitions & Ignition Cylinders",
                "Padlocks",
                "Mailbox Locks",
                "Office & Commercial Door Locks",
                "Storage Unit Locks",
